  "title": "Benne Wafers",
  "description": "Since I live in the South people refer to these cookies as Benne Wafers, they are actually Sesame Seed Cookies. Toasting benne (sesame) seeds develops their flavor and also gives these cookies a slightly crunchy texture.",
  "authors": [
    "Holly"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-01-06T11:06:52-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-01T23:38:25-04:00",
